WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.900
World Masterpiece Theater

00:07.800 --> 00:14.400
Homeless Child Remy

00:07.800 --> 00:14.400
"About Love"

00:15.260 --> 00:23.200
I continue wishing to see you

00:23.690 --> 00:28.360
Today we'll go on a journey

00:28.450 --> 00:32.310
That's as endless as the blue sky

00:32.820 --> 00:40.990
With joy, sorrow and hope come setbacks

00:41.360 --> 00:46.040
They repeat, they repeat

00:46.280 --> 00:50.870
What should I believe?

00:51.510 --> 00:59.880
You know nothing about love, however

01:00.320 --> 01:08.900
Someday you will feel warmth inside

01:09.730 --> 01:19.860
I dream of the day when you'll speak of love

01:20.860 --> 01:28.660
Tomorrow, our journey will begin

01:29.510 --> 01:35.000
Presented by:
Takara Fansubs & Migoto

01:35.020 --> 01:39.380
Episode 16:
A Kitten on a Rainy Day

01:44.410 --> 01:47.050
Remy! Remy! Wait!

01:47.050 --> 01:48.340
Let's go home together.

01:50.560 --> 01:54.720
I went to the alley by the Paris Cathedral to sell my flowers.

01:54.720 --> 01:56.910
What? That far away?

01:56.910 --> 02:01.670
Yeah, so my legs are really tired. But I sold all my flowers.

02:03.060 --> 02:04.160
Oh really?

02:04.820 --> 02:06.260
That's great!

02:07.600 --> 02:09.680
What a busy day...

02:28.390 --> 02:29.810
Where are you?

02:43.760 --> 02:45.120
How cute...

02:51.080 --> 02:53.380
Look at the time! I have to go home.

02:57.140 --> 02:58.460
See ya!

03:09.830 --> 03:13.400
You better go home now! It'll be dark soon. See ya!

03:18.500 --> 03:20.390
Don't you have a home to go back to?

03:31.660 --> 03:33.230
So cute...

03:33.230 --> 03:34.930
It's like furry knitting wool.

03:34.930 --> 03:36.390
Let me hold it!

03:36.390 --> 03:37.260
Okay.

03:37.920 --> 03:41.930
Wow... Cute. It's so furry, isn't it?

03:46.530 --> 03:47.640
It's okay.

03:47.640 --> 03:50.400
Wow... This cat is really attached to you.

03:51.950 --> 03:53.730
Uh, his name is Shiro.

03:53.730 --> 03:54.620
Shiro?

03:54.620 --> 03:55.860
Because his body is white.

03:55.860 --> 03:57.040
He said it's Shiro.

03:57.040 --> 03:57.990
It's a good name, isn't it?

03:58.360 --> 04:01.490
What'd you bring it here for?

04:01.490 --> 04:02.540
I want to keep it.

04:03.300 --> 04:05.580
There's no way our boss will let you.

04:05.580 --> 04:07.350
But I want to keep it!

04:07.350 --> 04:09.740
I want to have my own pet like Remy.

04:10.340 --> 04:15.710
Joli-Coeur and Capi are not my pets. They're my important friends.

04:16.130 --> 04:18.550
I want to be Shiro's friend.

04:18.550 --> 04:21.720
But... Like Mattia says, it seems impossible, doesn't it?

04:44.790 --> 04:45.990
Shhhhhh!

05:01.090 --> 05:02.130
Marcel!

05:02.740 --> 05:03.930
Y-yes?

05:05.300 --> 05:06.930
What are you doing?

05:07.390 --> 05:08.900
N-nothing...

05:08.900 --> 05:09.950
Hurry up and eat!

05:09.950 --> 05:10.680
Yes, sir.

05:12.000 --> 05:13.990
You too!

05:17.940 --> 05:20.650
I said... Shut up!

05:26.260 --> 05:29.450
You must be hungry. Eat it slowly.

05:29.450 --> 05:34.450
It's impossible to keep it here. If our boss finds out, you'll be in big trouble.

05:35.630 --> 05:37.060
He won't find it!

05:38.550 --> 05:42.050
I'll do my best not to let him find it. Okay, guys?

06:05.000 --> 06:09.250
Joli-Coeur, don't tease him! He's just a little cat!

06:15.810 --> 06:18.330
Joli-Coeur, come back here!

06:23.410 --> 06:25.050
Huh? What is that?

06:27.720 --> 06:29.050
Ow!

06:30.440 --> 06:31.550
Stop, Shiro!

06:34.780 --> 06:37.730
Hey! What are you guys doing!?

06:44.300 --> 06:45.700
Shh! Quiet now!

06:46.720 --> 06:49.880
I'm sorry... Um... Joli-Couer...

06:49.880 --> 06:51.240
Joli-Coeur?

06:51.660 --> 06:54.100
Joli-Coeur was playing a trick.

06:54.750 --> 06:59.860
Pah! Listen! If you make a fuss again, I won't let it slide.

07:03.100 --> 07:05.330
It's all right now. He's gone.

07:05.330 --> 07:07.680
Phew... I was so scared.

07:08.960 --> 07:11.170
Now do you understand?

07:11.710 --> 07:13.680
You can't keep a cat here.

07:15.810 --> 07:16.730
Get rid of it.

07:16.960 --> 07:17.940
What?

07:18.520 --> 07:19.720
Understand?

07:28.760 --> 07:33.520
Mattia, wouldn't it be all right for a couple of days? Marcel will-

07:33.520 --> 07:36.000
No way. I know we can't keep it.

07:36.810 --> 07:38.870
And he knows it too.

07:38.870 --> 07:40.630
Marcel, go and get rid of it.

07:41.910 --> 07:43.250
Don't you like animals?

07:43.250 --> 07:44.250
Huh?

07:44.600 --> 07:47.250
If you don't, you won't understand Marcel's feelings.

07:48.600 --> 07:49.720
Say that again!

07:49.720 --> 07:51.370
I'll keep saying the same thing!

07:51.370 --> 07:52.250
What?

07:52.250 --> 07:54.220
Remy... That's enough.

07:54.220 --> 07:55.370
No, it isn't!

07:56.580 --> 07:57.630
Let's keep the cat!

07:58.980 --> 08:02.270
Let's keep the cat! It's not good to give up.

08:02.270 --> 08:04.730
We can keep it if we work together.

08:04.730 --> 08:05.480
But...

08:05.480 --> 08:08.360
Leave it to me, I'll think of something.

08:21.270 --> 08:25.940
Newspapers! Newspapers!
Would you like a newspaper?

08:30.880 --> 08:34.370
Shiro... I'm almost done. Wait there quietly.

08:34.870 --> 08:36.750
Would you like a newspaper?

08:39.020 --> 08:41.110
Would you like some flowers?

08:41.110 --> 08:42.100
Lise!

08:42.100 --> 08:42.770
Remy!

08:43.530 --> 08:46.100
I found the perfect place. A house for the kitten!

08:46.100 --> 08:46.790
Really?

08:46.790 --> 08:50.300
Yes. I'm going to find Marcel now and tell him.

08:50.300 --> 08:52.290
Wow! I'm coming with you!

09:00.140 --> 09:03.540
Look at this! What do you think about making this Shiro's house?

09:05.570 --> 09:08.220
Yeah... It's pretty spacious.

09:08.220 --> 09:09.860
Let me see!

09:10.730 --> 09:11.960
Wow, it's great.

09:12.490 --> 09:16.220
Perfect, we can make Shiro a bed here.

09:16.870 --> 09:22.700
This place will be safe. If we bring his food here, no one will get in trouble.

09:22.700 --> 09:23.730
Thank you, Remy.

09:24.230 --> 09:27.310
I'm happy for you, Shiro.
This will be your home from now on.

09:38.660 --> 09:40.100
Hey, Shiro! This way!

09:42.570 --> 09:44.140
Ah... It's raining.

09:47.920 --> 09:50.580
Shiro, be good. Okay?

09:50.580 --> 09:53.170
I'll bring you some food tomorrow morning.

09:53.710 --> 09:55.030
Well, let's go home.

09:55.030 --> 09:56.020
Okay.

10:07.520 --> 10:10.090
I didn't expect it would rain this hard.

10:11.950 --> 10:14.440
I wish tomorrow would hurry up.

10:44.550 --> 10:45.610
Shiro...

11:11.500 --> 11:12.930
Remy, hurry up!

11:12.930 --> 11:13.680
Okay...

11:19.590 --> 11:21.440
Huh, he's not here.

11:23.390 --> 11:25.630
Huh? Yeah... He's not.

11:25.630 --> 11:27.110
I wonder where he went.

11:28.230 --> 11:29.750
Remy, what should we do?

11:29.750 --> 11:32.730
He's probably taking a walk. Let's find him.

11:32.730 --> 11:33.560
Okay.

11:34.750 --> 11:38.150
Shiro! Shiro! Where are you?

11:38.580 --> 11:40.990
Shiro, come here!

11:41.070 --> 11:41.740
Shiro!

11:42.200 --> 11:44.930
Shiro, Shiro! Where are you?

11:45.000 --> 11:47.950
Where are you, Shiro? Come here!

11:48.300 --> 11:49.520
Marcel!

11:51.460 --> 11:53.060
What's wrong, Marcel?

11:53.130 --> 11:55.010
Are you playing hide and seek with the kitten?

11:56.580 --> 11:58.170
Here you go. Give it to little Shiro.

12:00.380 --> 12:01.340
What's wrong?

12:01.900 --> 12:03.180
Shiro's gone.

12:03.180 --> 12:04.610
Huh?

12:09.860 --> 12:10.940
It's all my fault.

12:11.550 --> 12:13.370
It's because I left him alone.

12:13.370 --> 12:18.050
No... It's not your fault. It's because of the house I found him.

12:18.050 --> 12:21.340
He'll be all right. We'll find him soon.
- Huh?

12:21.390 --> 12:24.870
He's a little cat. He couldn't have gone too far, right?

12:25.420 --> 12:28.560
Ricardo's right. Let's find him together.

12:28.560 --> 12:29.870
We'll find Shiro.

12:30.340 --> 12:32.400
That's right. Let's find him.

12:35.960 --> 12:38.570
Shiro, Shiro! Come here!

12:38.570 --> 12:39.930
Here, I'll give you some bread.

12:39.930 --> 12:40.890
Come here, Shiro!

12:40.890 --> 12:43.140
Shiro, Shiro!

12:43.140 --> 12:44.380
Where has he gone?

12:44.980 --> 12:46.460
Hey, Shiro!

12:46.460 --> 12:47.890
Little cat? Where are you?

12:47.890 --> 12:50.690
Shiro, Shiro!

12:50.690 --> 12:52.480
You're a good boy, come here.

12:52.480 --> 12:56.840
Shiro, Shiro! Come here now!

13:00.730 --> 13:02.850
Still can't find that little cat.

13:02.850 --> 13:04.490
We looked but we couldn't find him.

13:04.490 --> 13:06.260
He might have gone out of the park.

13:06.260 --> 13:07.030
Into the street?

13:07.030 --> 13:07.910
Yeah.

13:07.910 --> 13:09.660
Why don't we ask Capi to find him?

13:10.100 --> 13:13.920
With all the rain last night, the smell has washed away.

13:14.490 --> 13:18.420
Well then, there's no other way to find him than splitting up and looking for him.

13:18.870 --> 13:19.810
That's right.

13:23.380 --> 13:25.830
Shiro, Shiro!

13:25.830 --> 13:26.840
Marcel!

13:26.840 --> 13:28.350
Oh Remy, did you find him?

13:28.350 --> 13:30.440
No... He wasn't over there either.

13:34.170 --> 13:37.800
I wonder if he was found by somebody else.

13:37.800 --> 13:38.740
Huh?

13:38.740 --> 13:41.570
Or he rushed into the street and was hit by a horse cart.

13:47.770 --> 13:49.330
Nothing happened to him.

13:51.120 --> 13:55.750
Don't give up. I'll go further over there and look for him.

13:55.750 --> 13:56.660
Remy!

13:56.660 --> 13:58.710
This time, Capi and Joli-Coeur will do their best too.

13:59.210 --> 14:00.460
I'm sure we'll find him.

14:05.790 --> 14:07.970
I heard Marcel's cat disappeared.

14:09.730 --> 14:11.550
How's it going?

14:12.490 --> 14:14.220
We haven't found him yet.

14:14.220 --> 14:16.570
We've searched all around here.

14:16.910 --> 14:19.220
I wonder where else we could search?

14:19.220 --> 14:20.060
Yeah...

14:20.590 --> 14:22.610
Quit searching for him!

14:22.610 --> 14:23.740
No!

14:23.740 --> 14:25.110
What about your work?

14:25.110 --> 14:26.000
Huh?

14:26.000 --> 14:28.250
Has anybody earned their money today?

14:33.050 --> 14:35.670
On top of that, it looks like it's going to rain.

14:35.670 --> 14:37.960
And it'll be raining harder than yesterday.

14:38.680 --> 14:39.740
Really?

14:39.740 --> 14:41.970
We have to start work now, or our boss...

14:41.970 --> 14:44.130
Marcel, we...

14:44.500 --> 14:47.790
It's okay. You guys hurry up and get back to work.

14:47.790 --> 14:48.950
How about you, Marcel?

14:48.950 --> 14:50.890
I... I will find Shiro.

14:53.470 --> 14:54.650
Marcel!

14:55.490 --> 14:59.150
<i>That idiot, liking his cat that much.</i>

15:01.750 --> 15:04.490
Oh... It's started to rain. Let's go.

15:13.530 --> 15:15.170
You're telling me you didn't earn your money!?

15:17.910 --> 15:21.330
That means you want me to have some leisure time.

15:25.320 --> 15:26.850
Marcel!

15:45.500 --> 15:49.360
Damn, the boss was smiling while he was hitting Remy and Marcel.

15:50.210 --> 15:52.710
I'm sorry, Remy. It's my fault.

15:52.710 --> 15:56.560
I'm sorry too for not being able to find Shiro.

15:56.560 --> 15:57.870
I'll find him tomorrow.

16:01.930 --> 16:05.000
Remy, if you do that you'll receive punishment from our boss tomorrow too.

16:05.000 --> 16:09.150
I don't mind getting hit by his lashes.

16:09.850 --> 16:13.110
Losing friends is more painful.

16:22.950 --> 16:28.450
So... So... Let's find Shiro.
Shiro is Marcel's friend.

16:29.070 --> 16:30.700
Remy, thank you.

16:31.380 --> 16:35.660
All right, I'll take care of your friend. I can handle it.

16:35.660 --> 16:36.680
I'll do my best too.

16:36.680 --> 16:37.410
Me too!

16:37.410 --> 16:39.150
Oh me too! Me too!

16:39.150 --> 16:40.490
Thank you, everyone!

16:43.850 --> 16:45.660
Shiro, Shiro!

16:45.660 --> 16:48.800
Where are you? Come here!

16:49.690 --> 16:52.300
Shiro, Shiro!

16:53.750 --> 16:57.310
Hey, Shiro! Shiro!

16:58.310 --> 17:00.560
Shiro, where are you?

17:04.130 --> 17:04.940
Oh...

17:06.940 --> 17:09.610
Mattia, what you are doing here?

17:09.610 --> 17:10.440
Nothing.

17:13.600 --> 17:15.990
Don't look at me like that. Go away now!

17:15.990 --> 17:17.010
Fine.

17:21.570 --> 17:23.870
Shiro, come here!

17:30.370 --> 17:32.140
Capi, did you find him?

17:38.590 --> 17:40.810
Shiro, Shiro!

17:45.550 --> 17:47.570
Shiro, where are you?

17:48.680 --> 17:49.770
Marcel...

17:57.830 --> 17:58.830
Shiro!

18:01.450 --> 18:02.810
Good boy!

18:04.410 --> 18:07.330
You must have been lonely. But it's all right now.

18:08.350 --> 18:12.430
Good... I'll find you a better hiding place.

18:12.430 --> 18:14.220
Let's take the cat home.

18:14.700 --> 18:17.030
Huh? But our boss...

18:17.030 --> 18:19.720
We can handle one cat.

18:29.540 --> 18:30.770
Marcel!

18:30.770 --> 18:33.270
Remy, I found Shiro!

18:33.270 --> 18:34.550
That's great!

18:41.950 --> 18:45.750
Ready? Watch, he comes when I call him.

18:46.230 --> 18:47.160
He does?

18:47.160 --> 18:48.510
I don't believe you.

18:48.910 --> 18:50.100
He does!

18:57.980 --> 18:59.720
Shiro, come here! Come here!

19:04.720 --> 19:06.650
Come on... Shiro...

19:07.240 --> 19:09.230
Oh yes, here, have some bread.

19:10.730 --> 19:11.890
Come here, Shiro.

19:12.990 --> 19:15.300
Haha! You're such a cheater.

19:15.300 --> 19:16.990
You're right... Shiro's so smart.

19:17.350 --> 19:20.130
He doesn't know his own name yet.

19:20.130 --> 19:23.750
Yes he does. A while ago he came when I called his name.

19:24.360 --> 19:25.630
Right, Shiro?

19:25.630 --> 19:26.710
Chocolat!

19:27.950 --> 19:29.000
Chocolat!

19:33.310 --> 19:35.000
Chocolat... Where have you been?

19:37.420 --> 19:39.890
I've been so worried.
I've been looking for you.

19:39.890 --> 19:42.450
Excuse me... That cat...

19:42.450 --> 19:43.860
His name is Chocolat.

19:43.860 --> 19:45.320
Is he your cat?

19:45.320 --> 19:49.710
He has been gone for a whole week, I've been so worried.

19:49.710 --> 19:51.230
But I'm happy to find him.

19:59.290 --> 20:01.040
Did you guys find him?

20:01.040 --> 20:03.250
Yes, Marcel did.

20:03.250 --> 20:04.540
Are you Marcel?

20:04.990 --> 20:09.510
You took care of him very well.
He looks so healthy. Thank you.

20:10.030 --> 20:11.540
Oh... Yeah...

20:11.540 --> 20:17.850
I'm glad. Oh yes, my mother said she will reward whoever finds our cat.

20:17.850 --> 20:18.820
Come with me.

20:18.820 --> 20:19.820
No, thank you!

20:20.820 --> 20:21.840
But...

20:21.840 --> 20:23.310
I don't want a reward.

20:27.450 --> 20:29.520
I'm happy for you that you can go home.

20:30.730 --> 20:31.790
Be well.

20:39.570 --> 20:41.000
What's wrong, Chocolat?

20:58.830 --> 20:59.920
Marcel...

21:01.120 --> 21:04.080
You can cherish Joli-Coeur instead of Shiro.

21:04.080 --> 21:06.770
He says he wants to become friends with you, Marcel.

21:10.180 --> 21:13.340
Um... I will cherish him as well as Shiro.

21:16.670 --> 21:17.530
Marcel!

21:17.960 --> 21:18.800
Don't go!

21:22.500 --> 21:23.500
Mattia...

21:25.770 --> 21:28.840
Shiro will be happier with that girl.

21:30.290 --> 21:33.470
Marcel knows that. Leave him alone.

21:36.850 --> 21:41.210
Marcel, keep moving forward... towards tomorrow.

21:41.070 --> 21:49.550
Try to love yourself more

21:50.700 --> 22:00.090
Abandoned dreams can be seen again

22:00.270 --> 22:08.770
Surely, not everyone can be so strong

22:09.880 --> 22:20.700
The blue sky lifts all of the world's tears...

22:21.230 --> 22:30.930
Tomorrow's courage comes

22:31.080 --> 22:40.950
From the future that gives us our fate

22:41.090 --> 22:49.750
Try to seek for them more

22:50.670 --> 22:54.420
Give your heart to

22:54.580 --> 23:10.450
That person who is also seeking you

23:18.200 --> 23:20.570
Cute, isn't it? I took it with me.

23:20.570 --> 23:22.320
Lise, that's not good.

23:22.320 --> 23:23.260
Huh?

23:23.260 --> 23:25.660
Let's return the doll, okay?

23:26.290 --> 23:28.940
She's nowhere to be found.

23:29.490 --> 23:30.410
Huh?

23:30.840 --> 23:32.660
Lise is somewhere in here?

23:32.800 --> 23:36.210
<i>A Pledge in an Underground Maze</i>

23:32.800 --> 23:36.210
Next time:
